%% Encryption at rest with customer-managed keys, all kept in the exposure's platform Key Vault. Per cluster: a KMS key
%% for the Secrets in etcd (KMS data encryption, the vault reached as a trusted service) and a disk key for the OS disks
%% of all its nodes (AKS allows one disk encryption set per cluster, not per node pool). Stateful cluster: also one key
%% per isolation zone for its volumes.
flowchart LR
    subgraph KV["Platform Key Vault of the exposure<br/>public access disabled, trusted services bypass, purge protection, delete lock"]
        ksl["Per cell<br/>key-&lt;cell&gt;-kms · key-&lt;cell&gt;-disk"]
        ksf["Stateful cluster<br/>key-sf-kms · key-sf-disk<br/>key-sf-pv-&lt;zone&gt;, one per isolation zone"]
        certs["cert-&lt;zone&gt;-… (section 4.1)"]
    end

    subgraph SL["Stateless cell (one per cell)"]
        slapi["Control plane: Secrets in etcd<br/>KMS data encryption, the key named without a version"]
        sldisk["Disk encryption set des-&lt;cell&gt; (cluster-wide, set at creation)<br/>→ ephemeral OS disks of the system pool and every zone node<br/>+ encryption at host"]
    end

    subgraph SF["Stateful cluster"]
        sfapi["Control plane: Secrets in etcd, KMS data encryption"]
        sfdisk["Disk encryption set des-sf<br/>→ OS disks of the system pool and the zone pools<br/>+ encryption at host"]
        sfpv["Disk encryption set des-sf-&lt;zone&gt;, one per zone<br/>→ StorageClasses &lt;zone&gt;-premium-zrs, … and the zone's Azure Files account<br/>→ persistent volumes and backups of the zone<br/>Azure Policy: a PVC only on its own zone's classes"]
    end

    note["Not possible in AKS: a disk key per node pool → one OS-disk key per cluster, application data separated per zone<br/>Rotation: a new key version every 12 months, no expiry dates; disk encryption sets and KMS data encryption follow the versionless key"]

    ksl -->|"Crypto User on the KMS key<br/>(control plane identity)"| slapi
    ksl -->|"Crypto Service Encryption User<br/>on the disk key, automatic rotation"| sldisk
    ksf -->|"Crypto User on the KMS key"| sfapi
    ksf -->|"Crypto Service Encryption User"| sfdisk
    ksf -->|"one key per zone"| sfpv

    classDef cp fill:#eceff1,stroke:#455a64,color:#000
    classDef sl fill:#e0f2f1,stroke:#00695c,color:#000
    classDef sf fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#ad1457,color:#000
    classDef note fill:#fffde7,stroke:#9e9d24,color:#000
    class ksl,ksf,certs cp
    class slapi,sldisk sl
    class sfapi,sfdisk,sfpv sf
    class note note
